02:00039EC4 00039ED0        	  4166:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039EC8 00039ED0        	  4167:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039ECC 00039F04        	  4168:     dc.l    Moldorm_Wander   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
                            	  4169: 
