                            	  5260: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003A698 0003A6A4        	  5261:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A69C 0003A708        	  5262:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
